50.6.3   Shape Background Markings
The third library for adding markings uses the background paths of certain shapes. This library is included
mostly for historical reasons, using the markings library is usually preferable.

                                                       651
TikZ Library decorations.shapes
   \usepgflibrary{decorations.shapes} % LATEX and plain TEX and pure pgf
   \usepgflibrary[decorations.shapes] % ConTEXt and pure pgf
   \usetikzlibrary{decorations.shapes} % LATEX and plain TEX when using TikZ
