    This key installs a polar axis system that can be used in a “scientific” publication. Two axes are created
    called the angle axis and the radius axis. Unlike “normal” Cartesian axes, these axes do not point
    in a specific direction. Rather, the radius axis is used to map the values of one attribute to a distance
