                     lovely        \pgftext[left] {lovely}}

     /pgf/text/right                                                                              (no value)
          The key causes the text box to be placed such that its right border is on the origin.

                              \tikz{\draw[help lines] (-1,-.5) grid (1,.5);
               lovely              \pgftext[right] {lovely}}

     /pgf/text/top                                                                                (no value)
          This key causes the text box to be placed such that its top is on the origin. This option can be
          used together with the left or right option.

