\pgfpointdiff{hstarti}{hendi}
    Returns the difference vector hendi − hstarti.

                              \begin{tikzpicture}
                                \draw[help lines] (0,0) grid (3,2);
                                \pgfpathcircle{\pgfpointdiff{\pgfpoint{1cm}{0cm}}{\pgfpoint{1cm}{1cm}}}{2pt}
                                \pgfusepath{fill}
