    on the sizes of the these shapes. Finally, when the node is drawn, the boxes are placed at the anchor
    positions text and lower.

                             \usetikzlibrary {shapes}
                      q1     \setbox\pgfnodeparttextbox=\hbox{$q_1$}
                     01      \setbox\pgfnodepartlowerbox=\hbox{01}
